/* =========================================================
   v15.98.40 — Live Charts Stability Fix
   v15.98.39 — Dedicated Live Charts
   Three continuous realtime charts (5m / 10m / 1h), vertically stacked.
   The live dot stops before the right edge so the adaptive price scale stays
   fully readable on every device. No continuous decorative animation beyond
   the live price pulse itself.
   ========================================================= */
/* Home launcher: balanced 2x2 grid on larger screens. */
.entry-actions .entry-action-pulse:where(:not(.app-shell, .app-shell *)),
